t. \n\nLink arrow: text 'Learn more' 16 Bold ink + arrow amber; hover: text amber; (use hover styling on dark).\n\nActually for CTA on dark band: text amber reads well. ✓\n\nAlso create 'Badge / Chip'? not needed.\n\nLet me also create the 'Filter / Open' in call B with dropdown.\n\nNow writing Call A for real. I'll keep ~350 lines.\n\nPotential pitfalls:\n- rescale on instance: exists ✓.\n- swapComponent on nested instance: exists ✓.\n- layoutSizingHorizontal on children of AL ✓ (new API; older: layoutAlign/layoutGrow). Use layoutSizingHorizontal ('FILL'/'HUG'/'FIXED') — supported in current API.\n- strokes: node.strokes, strokeWeight, strokeAlign.\n- effects: shadows: [{type:'DROP_SHADOW', color:{r,g,b,a}, offset:{x,y}, radius, spread, visible, blendMode:'NORMAL'}].\n\nOK writing. I'll do Call A now, then proceed.\n\nAlso! Set page.prototypeDevice? Not needed. Maybe set flow starting point: reactions create flow automatically.\n\nAlso the workspace page name is '03 · Workspace' ✓ exists (5:2) and empty.\n\nAfter building everything, screenshots: home & property at maxDimension 2048 maybe; library too.\n\nLet me write Call A.","signature":""}],"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8420bd2b-08e1-4650-9759-ee0744cf2f7f","uuid":"d808983d-9ffa-4eb0-a64f-870e44f68fd0","timestamp":"2026-11-01T23:47:08.640Z","thinking_duration_ms":334147}
